service.description:
Matrix POST room_keys/version for the current user: a new backup version ("1", "2", ...; never reused)
            with algorithm (m.megolm_backup.v1.curve25519-aes-sha2; stored as given) and auth_data (an object, at most 16 KB);
            it becomes the current one. reasonCode badRequest, tooLarge, tooMany (1000 versions).
